"{\"url\":\"https://www.microcision.com/expansion\",\"title\":\"EXPANSION | Microcision\",\"desc\":null,\"og\":null,\"robots\":null,\"imgs\":[\"Microcision logo.png | 31e942_ef154a865afe4fa79723417987ebbaeb~mv2.png\",\" | 31e942_dc8d3d6833784ae2b0d338ce426a7e73~mv2_d_11770_3078_s_4_2.jpg\"],\"form\":[],\"iframes\":[],\"sha256\":\"a27d71cb9819101bc5bc32820d56b5fd296b1f8e465cedaae294c335d99ec1f9\",\"text\":\"Skip to Main Content\\n\\nHOME\\n\\nSERVICES\\n\\nABOUT\\n\\nEXPANSION\\n\\nCAREERS\\n\\nCONTACT\\n\\nEXPANSION\\n\\nMicrocision's current facility is approximately 50,000 square feet. 16,000 square feet is completely refurbished for additional equipment and resources. The company also owns one acre of open ground for a contiguous building expansion.\\n\\n\\u00a9 2022\\u00a0by Microcision LLC\"}"
